个拱火乐子人。\r\n但是无论如何，这件事在表面上落幕了，水子提出了一个勉强能接受的表述，咩咩接受了道歉\r\n虽然中间不多说的部分，和谁说了啥，导致了这个冲动才是关键，但这部分涉及私密可能也不方便说，而且咩咩都展现出了对这部分的容忍和接受，大家也就没必要去追究了吧。\r\n虽然感觉咩咩有种错估自己在水子新种地位的不甘，但是剩下的就让他们自己解决就好了，不然拱火人对于咩咩伤害太大了，心疼温柔的咩子","time":1691195527166,"floor":53,"likes":9,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792199863","root":"792199863","user":{"id":"13200125","name":"我想知道永远有多远","avatar":"b185c42de1168696ee7d092e"},"text":"水～子～我的水子～～[emot=acfun,1672/][emot=acfun,1672/]","time":1691195389815,"floor":52,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792199832","root":"792199832","user":{"id":"1631983","name":"catchthewind","avatar":"8a36ede722fab6cd58cc9374"},"text":"事前还是要好好沟通[emot=acfun,1859/]","time":1691195269920,"floor":51,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792199783","root":"792199783","user":{"id":"72986007","name":"雨季丶看fā落丬","avatar":"c941fb5faef54469bae305c5"},"text":"[emot=acfun,2422/]还有20天，发了工资就来参加猴岛局。","time":1691195064562,"floor":50,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792199712","root":"792199712","user":{"id":"188928","name":"Allblue","avatar":"fe364a00ec980919a0c0c217"},"text":"还是事前沟通问题","time":1691194728899,"floor":48,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792199624","root":"792199624","user":{"id":"857329","name":"信生哥有仔生","avatar":"370881bfeea0fe1cd2d1b991"},"text":"冲动了水姐","time":1691194280095,"floor":47,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792199464","root":"792199464","user":{"id":"19027160","name":"好想爱这个世界啊😭","avatar":"1d8f978c2034553d8b9a208